Depends: ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends},
         phosh,
Description: System tray for Phosh (StatusNotifierItem + Background Apps)
 Phray is a Phosh quick-settings plugin that combines
 KStatusNotifierItem/AppIndicator tray icons and the GNOME Background
 Apps portal into a single tile, bringing desktop-style system tray
 functionality to Phosh-based mobile Linux.
 .
 Includes optional support for providing the
 org.freedesktop.impl.portal.Background backend itself, for systems
 where no other backend already provides it.
